; Synthesized terminal. `test/synth-terminal-v1` lowers a contentless
; (needs-sampler) sugar form into a (gpu-sampler :name default-sampler) the
; author never wrote — a resource that exists nowhere in the source document.
; The terminal head is declared (`:open true`) and listed in the sugar form's
; `:produces`; emitting an instance with no authored counterpart is exactly
; what hooks are allowed to do. One `(form … :open true)` per resource kind is
; all it costs to legalize a synthesized head.
(plugin :name gfx :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name needs-sampler :open true
    :lowering (lowering :hook test/synth-terminal-v1 :produces [gpu-sampler]))
  (form :name gpu-sampler :open true))

(needs-sampler)
